B.au_=new A.cx("What is AI Session Analysis?","From a session detail view, tap Analyze to get an AI summary of your overall session performance. The analysis looks at your logged stats, notes, and context to identify patterns, tilt indicators, and areas of focus for your next session.")
B.auf=new A.cx("Is there a limit on AI analysis?","Yes \u2014 AI analysis uses a cloud model and has daily usage limits to keep the service fast and fair: 20 hand analyses and 5 session analyses per day. Results are cached, so re-opening the same analysis doesn't count against your limit.")
B.auh=new A.cx("How accurate is the AI analysis?","The AI uses a state-of-the-art language model with strong poker fundamentals. It reasons well about common spots but can occasionally misjudge niche or highly exploitative lines. Treat it as a study partner, not an oracle \u2014 it's most useful for identifying patterns and blind spots.")
